This is a large test vector for Salsa20 that crosses the 4096-bytes
page boundary.

Signed-off-by: Tan Swee Heng <thesweeheng@gmail.com>

Note: The test vector is generated using a C++ program calling
Crypto++. Again we have assumed that the Crypto++ implementation is
sufficiently different from ours to make this a meaningful test. (If
they came from the same code base, they may have the same bugs.)

